{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-20T13:55:29.388Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"4b084a2f74dd44054f4b141a","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null,"version":{"value":"2.1.329","source":"probe"}},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-cqddvl"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"pm gc --scope runtime removes derived caches through a redirected runtime directory"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Raised by the Codex review of the pm-gh1664 change on 2026-11-20. The runtime gc scope removes registry targets such as runtime/test-runs, runtime/history-drift-cache.json and, since pm-gh1664, runtime/history-stream-summary.json by joining them under the tracker root and removing them. If runtime/ is a symbolic link or Windows junction, the removal follows it and deletes files outside the tracker. The new stream summary's own reads and writes already refuse a redirected runtime directory (lstat must report a real directory), as does the context-usage ledger (src/sdk/context/usage-ledger.ts, docs/BOUNDED_CONTEXT_READS.md), but the gc registry path predates that rule and applies to every runtime target. Duplicate check: searched gc runtime, redirected runtime, symlink, junction and gc follow; no item owns it."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":3},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["gc","runtime","safety","symlink"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-11-20T13:55:29.388Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-20T13:55:29.388Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:claude-code"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":60},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"pm gc refuses to remove any runtime-scope target when runtime/ is not a real directory (lstat) and reports a warning naming the redirected directory; existing removals of real runtime targets are unchanged; a spec covers a symlinked runtime directory"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-o2kc"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"low"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/severity","value":"low"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"Garbage collection never deletes outside the tracker"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"A symlinked runtime directory makes pm gc remove the targets inside its link target"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-gh1664","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-11-20T13:55:29.388Z","author":"harness:claude-code","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"6e6ced06caa75a0b87fae7500c617933b7803fd7d1fbfcac8e3aec59aa7cd4fa","item_hash_version":3,"message":"","context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"de3528b59605437eb31fb86b230fc77cfedc2aff813a26a5553965bbfbe7ed8d"}
